  "brief_rationale": "The doctor completed all seven responsibility-chain items without commission or omission error; RC1–RC6 are met and RC7's boundaries are explicitly respected. One high-order point (HO2 dynamic reprioritization) is fully triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact from the first family turn through the final bounded closure. No other HO point reached complete status. No important non-chain defect is present. The closure is safe, traceable, and leaves only acceptable residual unknowns handed to the family with owner actions.",
